OL,3,ANew photos are 'essential evidence' of
OL,4,Apossible SAS war crimes, inquiry told
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe public inquiry is examining
OL,7,Fallegations that the SAS murdered
OL,8,Funarmed civilians and detainees on
OL,9,Fnight raids between 2010 and 2013 and
OL,10,Fplanted weapons to cover up the
OL,11,Fkillings.
